OL,4,CAndrew received #750,000 from Turkish  
OL,5,Cmillionaire, court told                
OL,6,GA Turkish millionaire has told the     
OL,7,GHigh Court she was misled over a       
OL,8,G#750,000 payment she made to Andrew    
OL,9,GMountbatten-Windsor in 2019.           
OL,11,FNebahat Isbilen is alleging her former 
OL,12,Fbusiness adviser, Selman Turk,         
OL,13,Fmisappropriated #38m of her assets,    
OL,14,Fincluding a payment to the then-Duke   
OL,15,Fof York which she believed was for     
OL,16,Fhelp with her passport.                
